    "group": "Solar Spearhead",
    "summary": "Your ADEPTUS CUSTODES VEHICLE units gain more as they take losses. At Starting Strength, their models get +2 Objective Control, though not in an AIRCRAFT unit or a Battle-shocked one. Once below Starting Strength, attacks by their models re-roll Hit rolls of 1. Once Below Half-strength, those attacks re-roll Wound rolls of 1 as well as Hit rolls of 1.",
